<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Sept 26.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strong winds and low clouds have a 60 percent chance of closing Baltic state airports on September 27 and September 28, the Russian Weather Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
